# Whisper models and the TTS test fixture. Tens to hundreds of megabytes each,
# and reproducible byte-for-byte: `npm run fetch:model` fetches and verifies
# them against pinned SHA-256s, and the tests regenerate the fixture with `say`.
/models


# Glyph's hand-written Android layer: the assistant hook that makes a held side
# key open the capture screen. Re-included by name because `tauri android init`
# would replace or drop every one of these, and a new hand-written file has to
# be added here on purpose. (`dir/**` above, not `dir/`, is what lets these
# negations reach below an excluded directory.)
!src-tauri/gen/android/app/src/main/java/
!src-tauri/gen/android/app/src/main/java/com/
!src-tauri/gen/android/app/src/main/java/com/mattssoftware/
!src-tauri/gen/android/app/src/main/java/com/mattssoftware/glyph/
